Advantages of This Approach
No need for sentence-transformers: This reduces the installation size and complexity.

Uses OpenAI embeddings: You're already using OpenAI for prompt processing, so this keeps the setup consistent.

Lightweight: FAISS is efficient and works well for small to medium-sized datasets.

Alternative: Use Hugging Face Transformers (Lightweight)
If you still want to use a local embedding model (without sentence-transformers), you can use the transformers library with a smaller model like all-MiniLM-L6-v2.

Install the transformers library:

bash
Copy
pip install transformers
Update app/utils/rag.py:

